<title>UK: LME zinc ticks up in PM, copper firmer.</title>
<headline>LME zinc ticks up in PM, copper firmer.</headline>
<text>
<p>ZINC - Three months edges back up to unchanged levels after dipping in AM. September/threes trades at touch narrower $90 backwardation.</p>
<p>COPPER - Firmer, up about $20, after finding support under $2,300 in AM.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Straddling $1,700, probing upside.</p>
<p>NICKEL - Firmer, holds above $7,400. OTHERS - Quiet, unchanged.</p>
</text>
